			"updated": 1795614745116,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Why retry if no data is lost? The rows are already stored. Without a retry, a failed commit on a\npartition's LAST chunk keeps lag above 0 and a restart reprocesses that chunk.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "4NR_Di6Az1S6zUg_UNgTm",
			"originalText": "Why retry if no data is lost? The rows are already stored. Without a retry, a failed commit on a\npartition's LAST chunk keeps lag above 0 and a restart reprocesses that chunk.",
