			"updated": 1795614739421,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Cheat sheet\nlag(p) = end(p) - committed(p)     lag(t) = lag0 + (λ - μ) x t\ndrain time = lag0 / (μ - λ)     time-lag ≈ lag / λ     headroom = μ - λ",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
