			"updated": 1795614751286,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Sharpest edge: resolving the offset at hand-off = commit-before-work.\nIf the process crashes, every queued record is lost.\nEventPulse avoids C: the work happens inside the handler (A),\nso 'resolved' always means 'done'.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "ov-mDe73HCp_ufC4mRgPM",
			"originalText": "Sharpest edge: resolving the offset at hand-off = commit-before-work.\nIf the process crashes, every queued record is lost.\nEventPulse avoids C: the work happens inside the handler (A),\nso 'resolved' always means 'done'.",
